{"id":"lcss_similarity","title":"LCSS matched fraction","family":"elastic","definition":"echotime","intro_en":"LCSS counts an order-preserving set of sufficiently close sample pairs. Unmatched samples may be skipped, so the result describes matched coverage rather than the magnitude of every residual. The animation uses a tolerance of 0.35 and divides the match count by the shorter sequence length.","intro_zh":"LCSS 寻找保持先后顺序且足够接近的观测配对。未匹配点可以跳过，因此结果反映匹配覆盖率，不累加全部数值误差。本例容差为 0.35，并以较短序列长度归一化匹配数量。","steps_en":["Set the stated local scoring rule, tolerance and boundary conditions.","Count tolerance matches and carry forward the larger match count when skipping.","Trace the selected predecessor operations from the complete-prefix state.","Read the final score with the normalization explicitly stated below."],"steps_zh":["设置明确的局部计分规则、容差与边界条件。","累计容差内匹配，跳过观测时保留较大的匹配计数。","从完整前缀状态沿选定的前驱操作回溯。","按下方明确的归一化约定读取最终分数。"],"formula":"L_ij=L_(i-1,j-1)+1 if |x_i-y_j|<=epsilon, else max(L_(i-1,j),L_(i,j-1)); s=L_nm/min(n,m)","caveats_en":["Tolerance changes which pairs count as matches. Missing subsequences may be ignored by the shorter-length normalization.","The small arrays are an algorithm illustration, not evidence of retrieval or classification quality."],"caveats_zh":["容差改变哪些配对算匹配；以较短长度归一化可能忽略较长序列中未匹配的部分。","这些小数组用于解释计算过程，不构成检索或分类性能证据。"],"sources":[{"label":"tslearn: Longest Common Subsequence","url":"https://tslearn.readthedocs.io/en/stable/user_guide/lcss.html"},{"label":"EchoTime low-level similarity implementations","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/similarity_methods.py"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"normalization":"match count / min(n,m)","local_norm":"absolute difference","epsilon":0.35},"result":{"label":"similarity","value":0.9,"detail":"The explicit definition and parameters shown on this 